F1: state=newGame() one object; rnd(S)/mkRng mulberry32; finishTurn() resolves doProduction→doNeeds→doMorale→doStorm→doCaravan→clampCaps→maybeNewcomer in fixed order. Score 2.

F2: genMap(seed) derives 64-tile terrain from seed; canBuild() checks B.terr.includes(t.t); adjBonus() multiplies eff in bldEff(). Score 2.

F3: collector→ash, soilworks ash+water→soil, greenhouse soil+water→food, mine→ore, forge ore+power→metal; capOf()/clampCaps() cap and log overflow into S.lost. Score 2.

F4: colonist records {skill,fatigue,morale,job,at}; bldEff() reads c.skill, c.morale (moraleFactor), c.fatigue>=80 penalty. Score 2.

F5: doNeeds() consumes food/water, sets _fShort/_wShort; doMorale() applies -12/-15 morale or +3 recovery; moraleFactor() feeds bldEff. Score 2.

F6: 10 RESEARCH nodes; buyResearch() enforces n.pre and deducts cost; RBONUS read in bldEff, struts/forecast in doStorm, barter in buy/sellPrice, machining/medicine gate B.req in canBuild. Score 2.

F7: 12 EVENTS, weighted draw in drawEvent(); 5 events (refugees, cache, ventflare, sickness, blackmarket) have 2-3 choices with distinct state writes; S.evCd + EV_COOLDOWN enforced in drawEvent filter. Score 2.

F8: priceOf() reads S.res[g]/capOf and S.drift[g] (drift updated each turn in doCaravan); caravan.inv finite, decremented on caravanBuy/caravanSell both functional. Score 2.

F9: doStorm() fires on stormTimer, sev=1+floor(turn/15); damage() lowers hp read by bldEff hpF thresholds; windbreak/struts reduce via stormMitigation(); tryRepair() spends parts+idle colonist, restores hp=100. Score 2.

F10: saveState() = JSON.stringify(S) into textarea; loadState() parses, validates required fields/types, returns {err} shown in devout on bad input. Score 2.

F11: checkEnd() checks win (turn/pop/res/morale) and lose (pop===0), both called every finishTurn; score() combines pop/research/stock/turn; showEndModal() renders breakdown table. Score 2.

F12: switchTab()/button.onclick wiring; renderLog() prefixes "T"+l.t; many data-tip tooltips explain formulas; keydown handler for Space/Digit1-6; @media(max-width:420px) grid/table rules. Score 2.

F13: runTests() asserts caps, morale/fatigue bounds, save/load hash equality, event cooldown, prereqs — non-trivial; runBenchmark() runs policyTurn() headlessly, returns hashState(). Score 2.

G1: hasR(S,RBONUS[t.b]) read in bldEff(), rB=0.5 multiplies eff every production tick, tooltip shows bonus. Score 4.

G2: doNeeds shortfall → doMorale -12/-15 → moraleFactor(c.morale) multiplies wF in bldEff every turn. Score 4.

G3: doStorm→damage(t.hp-=amt)→bldEff hpF(70/30 thresholds)→tryRepair spends parts+colonist, hp=100 restores output. Score 4.

G4: priceOf() reads live S.res[g]/capOf scarcity and S.drift[g] drifted each turn in doCaravan; used by both caravanBuy/Sell. Score 4.

G5: refugees.go() adds colonists/spends res; sickness.go() calls setAssign()+bump(fatigue); blackmarket.go() swaps res/scrip — all mutate state beyond log. Score 4.

